OL,3,GNEWSAYour hosepipe ban questions
OL,4,Aanswered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hosepipe ban is in force across
OL,7,FDevon, Cornwall, the Isles of Scilly
OL,8,Fand parts of Dorset and Somerset as hot
OL,9,Fand dry weather puts pressure on the
OL,10,FSouth West's water supplies.
OL,12,FThe latest figures show Wimbleball
OL,13,FReservoir on Exmoor is at 14.9%
OL,14,Fcapacity. Other major reservoirs are
OL,15,Falso low, including Roadford in Devon
OL,16,Fat 36.8%, Burrator at 33.6%, Colliford
OL,17,Fin Cornwall at 35% and Stithians at
OL,18,F21.9%.
OL,20,FThe Environment Agency has classed
OL,21,FColliford and Wimbleball as having
OL,22,Fexceptionally low levels
OL,23,APub: 10-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
